        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rectangular Grip 24\" Satin Stainless Steel Mitered Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis rectangular door pull is made out of stainless steel. It is tough enough for commercial applications, but modern enough for use in the home. The 24 Inch Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull has an overall length of 25 inches. It is available with hardware for Thru-Bolt Mounting, Surface Mounting, and Back-to-Back Mounting. Choose from mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. The Satin Stainless Steel Finish means that it is easy to maintain.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-18T24FB-spc.gif?v=1704354563\" width=\"557\" height=\"135\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-CAN18T24FB-32D Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/36-inch-rectangular-satin-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>36\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-stainless-steel-48-inch-rectangular-pull\"><b>48\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/rectangular-60-inch-mitered-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>60\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/72-inch-satin-stainless-steel-rectangular-door-pull\"><b>72\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 24\" Stainless Steel Rectangular Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: <b>304 Stainless Steel Tubing</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24\" (610 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 25\" (635 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-5/8\" (66.7 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/8\" (92 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Width: 1\" (25.4 mm) x 1-1/2\" (38.1 mm)</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Limited quantities available.</b> <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact us</b></a> for more information.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull",
                "description": "Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull - This rectangular door pull is made out of stainless steel. It is tough enough for commercial applications, but modern enough for use in the home. The 24 Inch Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull has an overall length of 25 inches. It is available with hardware for Thru-Bolt Mounting, Surface Mounting, and Back-to-Back Mounting. Choose from mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. The Satin Stainless Steel Finish means that it is easy to maintain.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Rectangular Stainless Steel Pulls, 24 inch Stainless Steel Rectangular Pulls, 24 Stainless Steel Rectangular Pulls, 24 Stainless Steel Mitered Pulls, DWD-CAN18T24FB-32D, canaropa 18T24FB, storefront door pulls, storefront stainless door pulls, stainless storefront door pulls, 2 foot door pulls, square Door Handles, 24 rectangular Mitered pulls, modern door pulls, 24 inch commercial door pulls, Rectangular Grip 24 inch Satin Stainless Steel Mitered Door Pulls, satin stainless door pulls,"
